# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout (review of 2026-11-24, R30), so the web build and
# its tests are the same on every system. Gradle's Windows script keeps CRLF; binaries stay as they are.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
